  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce8c3aaff6426de4bb5da5734b8440a2, type: 3}
  m_Name: Danny's Missing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NewsArticleData
  newsImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cb3cf05fb950d504e86a709d9ff94cf5, type: 3}
  title: Locall Teen Missing After School, Investigation Ongoing
  description: "Police are investigating the disappearance of Daniel, a high-school
    student from a well-known and wealthy family, who was reported missing late Tuesday
    evening. According to authorities, Daniel was last seen leaving school grounds
    after regular classes and never returned home.\n\nSchool officials describe Daniel
    as a model student\u2014academically successful, well-behaved, and highly regarded
    by both teachers and classmates. \u201CHe was polite, disciplined, and never
    caused trouble,\u201D said one staff member. Friends echoed the sentiment, calling
    him \u201Cquiet\u201D and \u201Cfocused on his future.\u201D\n\nDespite an active
    investigation, police have so far found no physical evidence indicating Daniel\u2019s
    whereabouts. Search efforts around the school and nearby areas have yielded no
    results, and authorities have not ruled out any possibilities. Investigators
    are urging anyone with information, no matter how small, to come forward as concern
    grows within the community."
